---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Large-Scale Structure Cheat Sheet | Free Cosmic Web, Voids, Filaments"
  description="Complete large-scale structure cheat sheet with cosmic web, voids, and filaments. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Large-Scale Structure<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Cosmic web, voids, and filaments. From galaxy clusters to cosmic filaments.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cosmic Web</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Structure Components</h3>
        <pre><code>Filaments: thread-like structures
Walls: sheet-like structures
Voids: empty regions
Nodes: cluster intersections
Scale: 10-100 Mpc</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Galaxy Clusters</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Mass: 10¹⁴-10¹⁵ M_sun
Size: 1-10 Mpc
Galaxies: 100-1000
Hot gas: 10⁷-10⁸ K (X-ray emission)
Dark matter: ~ 85% of mass</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Observations</h3>
        <pre><code>X-ray: hot intracluster medium
Sunyaev-Zel'dovich: CMB distortion
Gravitational lensing: mass measurement
Velocity dispersions: dynamical mass</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Redshift Space Distortions</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Fingers of God</h3>
        <pre><code>Random motions: elongate in redshift space
Cluster velocity dispersion
Fingers pointing toward observer
Compressed along line of sight</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Baryon Acoustic Oscillations</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>BAO Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Sound horizon: ~ 150 Mpc
Standard ruler: fixed physical scale
Imprints on galaxy clustering
Measures expansion history
Complementary to CMB</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
